% the primary source was read; version or date strings are copied from it. Fields that could
% not be verified are omitted. Undated pages carry no year field; their key uses the access
% year (2026).
% Page ranges are written as first\BibHyphen{-}last. BibTeX still sees a hyphen, so IEEEtran
